Fulldata
The ecological example data were prepared for Mendoza, M. and Araujo, M. B.
(2022), Biogeography of bird and mammal trophic structures, Ecography,
2022(5), e06289, doi:10.1111/ecog.06289. See the dataset help and the cited
article's supporting information for the variable definitions and provenance.
This release redistributes the same data bytes as public CRAN version 0.1.0.

Transcdata_small
Derived by retaining the 1000 highest-variance variables from the cleaned
transcriptomic matrix deposited by Manuel Mendoza and Miguel Angel Medina:
High-dimensional transcriptomic dataset for the AMDconfigurations package
(2026), doi:10.5281/zenodo.18604443.
The deposited dataset is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ .
That dataset licence is not replaced by the package-code MIT licence.
The reduced matrix is byte-identical to the example already distributed in
public CRAN version 0.1.0; no new sample or gene values were introduced here.

Compatibility fixture
The legacy curve fixture was produced with public AMDconfigurations 0.1.0
to test inspection of historical objects. It is not new validation data.
